Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.94,0:23:49.94,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\bord4\be6\shad3\c&HFFB390&\pos(924.666,918)}感謝您的收看!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.08,0:22:05.92,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}いつも通り隣には君
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.92,0:22:09.22,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}変わらないよねずっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.22,0:22:13.85,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}測れない心模様騒がしいけど
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.85,0:22:19.31,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}声がちゃんと届ける距離にいて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.82,0:22:36.66,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}いつも通り教室の隅に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.66,0:22:41.00,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}君の横顔ばかり見てる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:44.59,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}あとどれぐらい近づけば
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.59,0:22:46.75,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}うまく伝えられる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.75,0:22:49.72,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}let's be ambitious
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.97,0:22:56.06,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}たった数センチの壁を超えて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.06,0:22:59.48,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}ずっとずっとそばにいてよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:03.31,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}鼻先が触れるくらいに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.31,0:23:07.36,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}頼りないい不安の声も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.36,0:23:11.11,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}照らす私のトワイライト
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.40,0:23:14.78,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}ずっとずっとそばにいてよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.78,0:23:17.91,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}この先の未来も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.91,0:23:23.21,EDJP-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}君と隣を歩いていたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.08,0:22:05.92,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}你如往常伴我身旁
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.92,0:22:09.22,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}希望能這樣到永遠
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.22,0:22:13.85,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}難以捉摸的心依舊不安寧
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.85,0:22:19.31,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}在聲音清晰可辨的距離內
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.82,0:22:36.66,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}在教室的那個角落
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.66,0:22:41.00,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}不禁凝視你的側臉
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.00,0:22:44.59,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}還要再靠近多少
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.59,0:22:46.75,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}才能將心意傳達
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.75,0:22:49.72,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}let's be ambitious
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.97,0:22:56.06,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}穿越你我間的窗戶紙
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.06,0:22:59.48,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}請永遠伴我身旁
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.48,0:23:03.31,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}讓我能感受到你的呼吸
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.31,0:23:07.36,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}連怯聲的呢喃
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.36,0:23:11.11,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}也是照耀我的夕陽
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.40,0:23:14.78,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}請永遠伴我身旁
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.78,0:23:17.91,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}今後的未來
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.91,0:23:23.21,EDCN-EP12,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}想同你並肩同行
